<title>HONG KONG: SBC Warburg names head of China research.</title>
<headline>SBC Warburg names head of China research.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg said on Wednesday it had appointed Charlotte Stephens as head of China research and Nonito Bernardo as an analyst in Philippines research.</p>
<p>Charlotte would join SBC Warburg in early 1997 from Crosby Securities where she, based in Hong Kong, covers China, it said.</p>
<p>Bernardo joined SBC Warburg early this month.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
